      "id": "02_the-veil-national-art-museum-of-andorra_261027",
      "stt": "02",
      "slug": "the-veil-national-art-museum-of-andorra",
      "title": "The Veil - National Art Museum of Andorra",
      "subtitle": "",
      "description": "Designed for the 120 Hours 2024 International Competition - reinterpreting the Pritzker-exclusive prompt for the National Art Museum of Andorra - The Veil addresses economic stagnation and cultural identity in the heart of the Pyrenees. Positioned as a catalyst for economic revitalization and spatial transformation, the museum balances global architectural appeal with local authenticity.   The project conceptualizes a \"tree-like\" structure made of vertical steel poles that release water vapor to form a cloud-like canopy and reflecting layer, echoing the surrounding pine forests, mountain mist, and cascading waterfalls. By blurring the boundaries between historical heritage, natural landscape, and contemporary art, The Veil stands as a timeless sanctuary reflecting the spirit of Andorra.",
      "status": "published",
      "dateAdded": "2026-10-27",
